- Parts watertight, 0 bad edges, 1 body each [[base]] [[gear1]] [[gear2]] [[gear3]] [[gear4]]; volumes 19316.4/3421.4/940.5/1879.6/578.5 mm3 [[base]] [[gear1]] [[gear2]] [[gear3]] [[gear4]].
- Bounds [[base]] [[0,0,0]-[100,60,14.4]], [[gear1]] [[-15,-15,0]-[15,15,16.5]] with 16.5 crank height [[gear1/crank_peg]] [[gear1/crank]], [[gear2]] [[gear3]] [[gear4]] per spec.
- Bed support [[base/bed]] 5968.5mm2, assembly bed [[assembly/bed]] 5968.5mm2; fits Bambu Lab A1, no supports, declared overhangs/bridges ok [[G5]].
- Details measured: plate 3.0mm [[base/plate_thickness]], plate full [[base/base_plate]], pin [[base/pin_gear2]] cap [[base/cap_gear2]] full, leaf 50% [[base/detent_leaf]], flange full [[gear1/detent_flange]], notch 94.6% empty [[gear1/detent_notch_south]], tooth witness boxes 81.75% [[gear1/tooth_east]], 80.9% [[gear2/tooth_east]], 81.78% [[gear3/tooth_east]], 79.9% [[gear4/tooth_east]], bores dia 6.79mm [[gear1/bore]] [[gear2/bore]] [[gear3/bore]] [[gear4/bore]], webs 7.5/5.0mm [[gear1/gear_web]] [[gear2/gear_web]] [[gear3/gear_web]] [[gear4/gear_web]].
- Views seen: sheets of final meshes, all-instances assembly view, close views of detent arm [[base/detent_arm]], caps [[base/pin_caps]], crank [[gear1/crank]] and teeth [[gear1/teeth]] [[gear2/teeth]] [[gear3/teeth]] [[gear4/teeth]] [[G7]].
- Assembly [[assembly]]: each instance congruent to its part, copies 1 each, one group, held with no exit direction gear1 gear2 gear3 gear4.
